      "content": "rebuild what?? there's nothing left to rebuild. the foundation is just... gone. it's not even about the money or the house, it's like i spent two decades pouring everything i am into something that turned out to be nothing. like i've been playing a game where the rules changed halfway through and i lost everything i worked for. i'm just so tired of the effort. it feels like i'm just running on a treadmill that's eventually gonna break. i'm just done.",
